sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Frontend / API client
    participant B as chat.py::build_flow
    participant Z as authorization.guards<br/>(LangflowAuthorizationService)
    participant Q as JobQueueService
    participant E as EventManager
    participant G as Graph (lfx)
    participant V as Vertex (lfx)
    participant K as Component (lfx)
    participant CS as ChatService

    C->>B: POST /build/{flow_id}/flow
    B->>B: _read_flow(session, flow_id, user.id)
    B->>Z: ensure_flow_permission(user, EXECUTE, ...)
    Z-->>B: allow (OSS) or 403/404 (plugin)
    B->>Q: start_flow_build(): create_queue(job_id)
    Q-->>B: (queue, EventManager)
    B->>Q: start_job(job_id, generate_flow_events(...))
    B-->>C: {job_id}

    Note over Q,CS: background task, decoupled from the HTTP request
    Q->>G: create_graph() / build_graph_from_db()
    Q->>CS: set_cache(flow_id, graph)
    Q->>G: sort_vertices()
    loop each runnable vertex
        Q->>G: build_vertex(vertex_id, get_cache, set_cache)
        G->>V: build(...)
        V->>K: instantiate_class(...), run outputs
        K-->>V: results / artifacts
        V-->>G: VertexBuildResult
        G-->>Q: next runnable vertices
        Q->>E: end_vertex event
    end
    Q->>E: on_end()
    C->>B: GET /build/{job_id}/events (polling)
    B-->>C: events from queue
